-**Seedlings.** Put a ×2 seedling token on Caylion's starting colony and on any colony Caylion takes from the colony bid track. Do not add one merely because another player trades a colony to Caylion. A seeded colony's economic converter may run twice each Economy, with both uses simultaneous with all other converters. The token does not double upgrade costs or upgrade-converter uses. It stays through flipping, doubles the new economic converter, and stays on a traded colony for its new holder. Remove the token from play when its colony is discarded beneath the colony deck.
+**Seedlings.** Caylion's starting colony receives a ×2 seedling token. Add a new seedling when **Caylion itself takes a colony from the colony bid track**. A **tokenless colony received by trade gains no new seedling**, regardless of which player took it from the bid track earlier. A seeded colony's economic converter may run twice each Economy, with both uses simultaneous with all other converters. The token does not double upgrade costs or upgrade-converter uses. It stays through flipping, doubles the new economic converter, and stays on a traded colony for its new holder. Remove the token from play when its colony is discarded beneath the colony deck.
 
